   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## A short film in three shots\n\nThe timeline is the script. **Scene Stills** paints one picture per scene with the image model (each over the one before, so light and palette carry), and MiniMax H3 plays them as three shots with real motion and sound: pictures that already tell the story, a video model that only has to move them.\n\n- Change the story in the Director: scene prompts are what is on screen, camera blocks are the move of each shot.\n- `style` on Scene Stills is the look of the whole film, written once.\n- `continuity` 0.5 keeps the stills related; lower it for freer compositions.\n- **Camera → Prompt** has `cuts` on: every scene is a shot, not a morph.\n- Ships fast: Turbo LoRA on, H3 Latent Upscale off.\n- Objects, places and hands read better than faces at this size."
   ]
  },
